<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>GreggEats LLC – Marketing That Works for You</title>
  <meta name="description" content="GreggEats LLC is a user-friendly, tech-savvy marketing partner helping brands grow with smart strategies and creative solutions." />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      color: #222;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header, section, footer {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f0f0f0);
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #34495e;
    }
    p {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 1rem auto;
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
    .tagline {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #2ecc71;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .cta {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
      background-color: #2ecc71;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #27ae60;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #888;
      background-color: #f0f0f0;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #2ecc71;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.25rem;">GreggEats LLC</div>
    <div>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header>
    <h1>Welcome to GreggEats LLC</h1>
    <div class="tagline">Smart, Friendly Marketing Solutions for Ambitious Brands</div>
    <p>We're here to help your business grow, stand out, and connect with real people through clever strategies, simple tools, and a touch of fun. Let’s work together to bring your ideas to life.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Get Started</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About GreggEats</h2>
    <p><strong>GreggEats LLC</strong> is a modern marketing agency focused on making tech feel human. We combine thoughtful strategy with creative design and the latest tools to help businesses and creators shine.</p>
    <p>Whether you're launching something new or growing something great, we're here to make the journey easier — and a little more fun.</p>
    <p>We help startups, creators, and brands:</p>
    <ul style="max-width:800px; margin:1rem auto; list-style: inside square;">
      <li>Build better websites and digital experiences</li>
      <li>Create engaging content and campaigns</li>
      <li>Use automation to save time and money</li>
      <li>Tell stories that connect with real people</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>At GreggEats, we believe smart marketing should be clear, approachable, and enjoyable.</strong></p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Let’s Chat</h2>
    <p>We’d love to learn more about your goals and how we can support you. Whether you’re ready to launch or just exploring options, we’re happy to help.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@greggeats.com">Say Hello</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 GreggEats LLC. Crafted with care for creators and dreamers.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
